{"detail": {"templateUuid": "a42017825b0f4d6196d71a72a679fc67", "projectUuid": "f983f1727e8b4afb96286ef266b285f0", "name": "美梦人生", "description": "在不远的未来，梦境已经被平台商业化。\n\n广告伪装成人物、道具和剧情，悄无声息地侵入每一个梦。高清需要付费，免广告需要升级，想继续梦里的关键剧情，还要购买“超前点映”。\n\n一个长期睡眠不足的普通上班族，只想在上班前做完一个完整的好梦。\n\n可当商业规则进入梦境，睡眠也成了一种消费。\n\n献给每一个睡不够、躲不开广告，也关不掉生活的人。", "coverUrl": "/assets/62557064fb062d6c.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/50fd3aebb15b4392b0c84db1a78cdad0/4a7271983ffb0d380560363875e2987845df4303.mp4", "snapshotId": 24891, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 3046138, "ownerUuid": "50fd3aebb15b4392b0c84db1a78cdad0", "avatar": "/assets/77dc2b7d4d697f2c.webp", "nickname": "走青丨zauceng", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 12, "tags": [{"id": 3040, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "广告导演请就位", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3042, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "2-故事短片", "parentTag": 3040, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3040/3042", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5001, "name": "先锋", "icon": "/assets/15bcb4d002b68470.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/b40570481582e92f.webp", "desc": "LibTV先锋作者", "verifyLevel": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "39 【当梦境成为最后一块广告位 - 走青丨zau ceng | 小红书 - 你的生活兴趣社区】 😆 xLHK1btpBw05ByP 😆 https://www.xiaohongshu.com/discovery/item/6a49f0d9000000000f005da3?source=webshare&xhsshare=pc_web&xsec_token=ABSOV6Tye9SIUwh_DkeRhH8oLW_vzXwCYhm3mY0gA5mLU=&xsec_source=pc_share", "createAt": "2026年07月07日 14:35", "updateAt": "2026年07月09日 22:11", "publishAt": "2026年07月07日 14:35", "playCount": 2, "viewCreationProcessCount": 0, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/a42017825b0f4d6196d71a72a679